flowchart TD
    D[Personal document and chosen local document]
    S[Check KDL, shapes and duplicates everywhere]
    L[Check all legacy templates eagerly]
    P[Expand selected profiles; reject unknown names and cycles]
    F[Fold patches; preserve value origins]
    C[Compile final active routes and validate parameters]
    T[Resolved Templates snapshot]
    I[Inspection: structured words and origins]
    R[Require selected kind; fill runtime slots]
    A[Argv: direct execution]
    D --> S --> L --> P --> F --> C --> T
    T --> I
    T --> R --> A
    X[Unselected profile bodies and unused command templates]
    S -. structural validation only .-> X
